ENGINE_LOADED(3697,{"ws":3697,"brand":"Writesonic","study":{"id":7114,"name":"A-ORG-WS-90D","created":false},"pillars":[{"id":"p1","name":"Level the marketing field","name_zh":"拉平营销资源差距","verdict":"whitespace","headline":"Inequity stifles innovation; shared resources elevate all.","headline_zh":"不平等扼杀创新；共享资源成就所有人。","territory":"Small and mid-sized teams feel outgunned: new channels such as ChatGPT ads appear faster than they can learn them, and manual marketing work eats the budget. Search Atlas leads this conversation (20 posts, 1,060 engagements) while Writesonic has 2 posts.","territory_zh":"中小团队感到资源不足：ChatGPT 广告等新渠道出现得比他们学得快，手工营销工作吞噬预算。Search Atlas 主导这一话题（20 帖、1,060 次互动），Writesonic 仅 2 帖。","persona":{"themeId":54951,"title":"The Strategic Innovator","characterId":1269,"characterName":"Livia Stratton","summary":"Tech-savvy marketer and founder who uses AI, SEO and digital marketing to grow a business and a career; driven by knowledge, efficiency, empowerment and peer recognition.","created":false},"tension":{"themeId":54957,"type":"pain_points","title":"Navigating the Complex Landscape of Modern Marketing and Business Growth","summary":"SMEs miss ROI on new ad channels, drown in complex digital tasks done by hand, and waste budget on outdated methods; they need automation and better-run marketing to scale."},"angle":{"id":14355,"type":"sociological","title":"Inequitable Access to Marketing Resources","text":"Resource Dependence Theory: smaller firms depend on marketing expertise and tools they do not control, so they fall behind larger competitors that can afford them.","created":false},"story":{"id":1855,"title":"Inequity stifles innovation; shared resources elevate all.","narrative":"The Digital Divide: Livia meets Oliver, a small online retailer outspent by bigger rivals and locked out of the SEO and social tactics they use with ease. Seeing resource dependence at work, she pools marketers into free seminars for small businesses. A sharing community forms, Oliver's sales double, and Livia concludes that a rising tide lifts all boats.","created":false},"propositions":[{"id":5316,"type":"usp","title":"Turn Visibility into Victory: Empowering Every Business to Compete","text":"Writesonic's GEO platform not only identifies gaps but also provides actionable fixes that help level the marketing playing field. Tagline: \"Your Success is Our Business: Stand Out with Writesonic's AI Solutions.\"","created":true},{"id":5315,"type":"rtb","title":"Resource Equality: The Fuel for Marketing Innovation","text":"Leveraging AI to analyze visibility gaps, Writesonic empowers every business to refine its strategies, regardless of size. Tagline: \"Fuel Your Innovation.\"","created":true},{"id":5314,"type":"product_features","title":"From Decline to Rise: Write Your Success Story with Writesonic","text":"Utilize our citation decay analysis to breathe new life into your marketing efforts, even against bigger players. Tagline: \"Rescue your citations, reclaim your brand.\"","created":true}],"kpi":{"evidencePosts":36,"engagement":1093,"brandPosts":2,"brandEng":29},"sov":{"brandShare":3.5,"categoryShare":10.7,"brandPosts":2,"brandTotal":57,"catPosts":34,"catTotal":319},"trend":{"months":["2026-04","2026-05","2026-06","2026-07"],"brand":[0,0,2,0],"category":[4,9,12,9]},"trendNote":"Monthly organic post counts in this SOMIN theme (posts-aggregate with clusterIds, study window 2026-04-20 to 2026-07-19): April covers 20-30 Apr and July 1-19 Jul only. Category = Search Atlas + Arvow + SEObot + Outrank (SEObot and Outrank post 0). Writesonic appears only in June (2 posts); Search Atlas supplies most category posts early, Arvow from June.","examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682883349,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-09-10","img":"e682883349","text":"GPT-6 Astra searches the web 40% less than the model before it.\n\nWe ran OpenAI's new flagship through the study we've run on every ChatGPT model this year, and the newer, more capable model reaches for the open web far less than its predecessor did.\n\nThe searches it does run barely touch reviews…","metrics":{"likes":25,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.857},"why":"Timely data point (GPT-6 Astra searches the web 40% less) that keeps lean teams current on how AI engines choose sources.","why_zh":"及时的数据洞察（GPT-6 Astra 联网搜索减少 40%），帮助精简团队跟上 AI 引擎选取信源的变化。"},{"postId":682463959,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-24","img":"e682463959","text":"ChatGPT is now running sponsored ads inside its answers. \n\n4.71% of answers contain one ad, and it's growing.\n\nBig brands are already buying these AI ads. (which is 20,000+ ads per day): ⬇️\n\nThe leaderboard (as of this week, by June 23):\n\n→ Samsung: 1,938 appearances\n→ Apple: 1,354\n→ Nike: 911\n→…","metrics":{"likes":80,"comments":74,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Puts the brand-new ChatGPT ads channel in front of marketers who would otherwise miss it; it drew 74 comments.","why_zh":"把刚出现的 ChatGPT 广告渠道带到可能错过它的营销人面前，获得 74 条评论。"},{"postId":682538967,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-07-29","img":"e682538967","text":"You don't need to move to San Francisco to build a global AI company.\n\nI started Writesonic in Y Combinator's S21 batch. We're incorporated in Delaware, but I've always run the company from India.\n\nWe've been fully remote since 2021. Most of the team is in India. Sales and marketing are in the US…","metrics":{"likes":94,"comments":10,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Founder story of building a global AI company from India with a lean, AI-agent-heavy team: access matters more than deep pockets.","why_zh":"创始人讲述在印度以精简、重度依赖 AI 代理的团队打造全球 AI 公司：机会比财力更重要。"}],"mofu":[{"postId":682463962,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-22","img":"e682463962","text":"𝗖𝗵𝗮𝘁𝗚𝗣𝗧 𝗮𝗱 𝗽𝗲𝗻𝗲𝘁𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗷𝘂𝗺𝗽𝗲𝗱 𝟯𝟬𝟬× 𝗹𝗮𝘀𝘁 𝘄𝗲𝗲𝗸. We just launched the AI Ads Index to track it daily.\n\nOpenAI announced ChatGPT's ad beta in February. For three and a half months, almost nothing happened. Fewer than five responses out of ten thousand carried a paid placement on most days.\n\nIn late…","metrics":{"likes":75,"comments":4,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Explains what the free, public AI Ads Index shows (ad frequency, top brands, industries, markets): a shared resource on a new channel.","why_zh":"介绍免费公开的 AI Ads Index 能看到什么（广告频率、头部品牌、行业、市场）：关于新渠道的共享资源。"},{"postId":682748449,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-08-24","img":"e682748449","text":"We are proud to be recognized by G2 as one of the Easiest To Do Business With AI partners for enterprise buyers.\n\nFor us, that recognition goes beyond the product. It reflects the entire experience we’re trying to build, from getting started to getting real value from it.\n\nThank you to our…","metrics":{"likes":25,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"G2 'Easiest To Do Business With' recognition: credibility that lowers the barrier for teams without big procurement resources.","why_zh":"G2「最容易合作」认可：为缺少采购资源的团队降低门槛的可信背书。"},{"postId":682464017,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-30","img":"e682464017","text":"Day 1 at brightonSEO. We are live at Booth 17.\n\nThe team's deep in conversations about GEO. Stop by and we'll pull up your brand's AI visibility report live on the platform. \n\nYou'll see where you're getting cited, where you're missing, and what's actually moving the needle.\n\n📍 Booth 17 · 30 April…","metrics":{"likes":96,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Booth invitation to see your brand's AI visibility report live: a product demonstration with no sign-up asked.","why_zh":"邀请到展位现场查看品牌 AI 可见度报告：不要求注册的产品演示。"}],"bofu":[{"postId":682936063,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-09-15","img":"e682936063","text":"If I had 30 minutes to show someone what Writesonic can do today, this is how I’d spend it.\n\nI’m doing exactly that on September 17.\n\nA live walkthrough of the platform, how to get started, and time for questions.\n\n12:00 PM ET / 9:00 AM PT\n\nLink to register in the comments.","metrics":{"likes":29,"comments":3,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"ABOVE_AVERAGE","conf":0.813},"why":"Explicit registration CTA for a 30-minute live walkthrough of the platform.","why_zh":"明确的报名号召：30 分钟平台直播演示。"},{"postId":682464019,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-05-18","img":"e682464019","text":"every week I get on a call with a content team that's doing everything right.\n\npublishing consistently. ranking on Google. clean technical SEO.\n\nand they still can't figure out why ChatGPT won't mention them.\n\nthe answer is almost always the same. they've built a strong on-site footprint and…","metrics":{"likes":45,"comments":3,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Free webinar registration framed around what to prioritise 'when you're a lean team'.","why_zh":"免费网络研讨会报名，主题围绕「精简团队」该优先做什么。"},{"postId":682463947,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-29","img":"e682463947","text":"2 days until we go live, and the seats are filling!\nIf cross-engine citation tracking is eating your team's week, this is the session to block off.\n🔗 Register now: Wednesday, July 1 at 2 pm ET. [Link In Comments]\n\nSam Garg, Founder and CEO of Writesonic, will walk through a citation-outreach fleet…","metrics":{"likes":15,"comments":2,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"One of only 2 Writesonic posts SOMIN placed in this tension: register-now CTA for a session on AI agents that take citation outreach off the team.","why_zh":"SOMIN 归入该痛点的仅有 2 条 Writesonic 帖子之一：立即报名，了解替团队承担引用外联工作的 AI 代理。"}]}},{"id":"p2","name":"Results over old playbooks","name_zh":"结果胜过旧打法","verdict":"contested","headline":"Innovation thrives where skepticism breeds growth.","headline_zh":"怀疑催生成长，创新由此而生。","territory":"Buyers are sceptical of tools and agencies that report problems without moving results, and want practical, efficient ways to adopt AI. Writesonic is active here (10 posts) but Search Atlas earns almost 3x its engagement (634 vs 222).","territory_zh":"买家对只报告问题、不推动结果的工具和代理商心存怀疑，希望以务实高效的方式采用 AI。Writesonic 在此活跃（10 帖），但 Search Atlas 的互动量接近其 3 倍（634 对 222）。","persona":{"themeId":54951,"title":"The Strategic Innovator","characterId":1269,"characterName":"Livia Stratton","summary":"Tech-savvy marketer and founder who uses AI, SEO and digital marketing to grow a business and a career; driven by knowledge, efficiency, empowerment and peer recognition.","created":false},"tension":{"themeId":54961,"type":"relevance","title":"Navigating the New Financial Landscape: Streamlining Success with Technology","summary":"People want efficient, technology-led ways to grow and cut costs but fear adopting new tools; they look for clear, practical guidance that balances quality, cost and shifting market demands."},"angle":{"id":14361,"type":"behavioural_economic","title":"Skepticism Towards Traditional Models","text":"Loss Aversion: frustrated by service models that never delivered tangible results, people turn to new technology that promises to cut their losses and improve outcomes.","created":false},"story":{"id":1856,"title":"Innovation thrives where skepticism breeds growth.","narrative":"Beneath the Surface of Funding: Livia meets Sophie, a small-business owner burned by costly marketing that never delivered. Sophie's skepticism exposes the loss aversion behind every spend. Instead of selling another flashy tool, Livia pairs new technology with transparency, real-time analytics and realistic expectations, turning doubt into a results-led approach.","created":false},"propositions":[{"id":5319,"type":"usp","title":"Transform skepticism into results","text":"Writesonic's AI-driven platform not only identifies gaps but actively fills them, combining gap analysis with execution. Tagline: \"From doubts to domination: level up your visibility with Writesonic!\"","created":true},{"id":5318,"type":"rtb","title":"Break free from the ordinary with Writesonic's bold AI solutions","text":"With 10,000+ teams trusting Writesonic, embrace modern marketing tactics that work. Tagline: \"Redefine the rules; write success on your terms.\"","created":true},{"id":5317,"type":"product_features","title":"Revolutionize Your Strategy: Make Skepticism Work for You","text":"Leverage Writesonic's analytics to address citation decline, ensuring your brand thrives through data-driven decisions. Tagline: \"Innovate, Adapt, and Succeed with Writesonic!\"","created":true}],"kpi":{"evidencePosts":55,"engagement":863,"brandPosts":10,"brandEng":222},"sov":{"brandShare":17.5,"categoryShare":14.1,"brandPosts":10,"brandTotal":57,"catPosts":45,"catTotal":319},"trend":{"months":["2026-04","2026-05","2026-06","2026-07"],"brand":[4,0,2,4],"category":[1,8,16,20]},"trendNote":"Monthly organic post counts in this SOMIN theme (posts-aggregate with clusterIds, study window 2026-04-20 to 2026-07-19): April covers 20-30 Apr and July 1-19 Jul only. Category = Search Atlas + Arvow + SEObot + Outrank (SEObot and Outrank post 0). Category volume grows each month (mostly Arvow from June); Writesonic posts in April, June and July.","examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682463998,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-24","img":"e682463998","text":"You can’t willy-nilly your AI Search program. \n\nOrganic AI Search is too big, the models change too often, and the visibility signals come from too many places.\n\nBrands need a department responsible for connecting the work across SEO, content, digital PR, social, reviews, video, partnerships, and…","metrics":{"likes":35,"comments":15,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Reshared practitioner post built on Writesonic research: ad-hoc prompt checks no longer work, so the old way of running search must change.","why_zh":"转发的从业者帖子，基于 Writesonic 研究：零散的提示词检查已不管用，旧的搜索运营方式必须改变。"},{"postId":682464106,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-20","img":"e682464106","text":"“AEO is trending.”\nThat is the shallow read.\n\nThe bigger story is that marketers are finally searching for the consequences of AI search, not just the novelty of it.\n\nThe problem has become real enough to name.\nYou can call it \"Answer Engine Optimization\" or \"Generative Engine Optimization\". \n\nAnd…","metrics":{"likes":9,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"No-CTA observation that AEO/GEO is now a named problem; it challenges the 'shallow read' of the trend.","why_zh":"无号召的观察：AEO/GEO 已成为被命名的问题，挑战对这一趋势的「浅层解读」。"},{"postId":682463977,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-07-09","img":"e682463977","text":"\"We've had brands check ChatGPT, see their own name come up, and go: we're fine. Job done.\"\n\nThey weren't fine. It was just AI flattering them.\n\nChristian Goodrich walked through this live yesterday with Samanyou Garg. \n\nThis clip is 2 minutes but it'll change how you think about tracking AI…","metrics":{"likes":7,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Two-minute clip warning that seeing your brand in ChatGPT can be 'AI flattering' you; it targets complacency, not a sale.","why_zh":"两分钟片段提醒：在 ChatGPT 里看到自家品牌可能只是「AI 在恭维你」，针对自满而非推销。"}],"mofu":[{"postId":682463956,"src":"paid","net":"google","date":"2025-07-06","img":"ea682463956","text":"A GEO Platform That Acts. Most GEO tools show the gap. Writesonic ranks it, runs the fix, proves the lift.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.861},"why":"Google search ad positioned against tools that only show the gap; comparison copy with no direct offer.","why_zh":"Google 搜索广告，针对「只展示差距」的工具进行定位；对比式文案，无直接优惠。"},{"postId":682463953,"src":"paid","net":"google","date":"2025-07-06","img":"ea682463953","text":"Writesonic vs Peec AI - They Analyze. We Take Action. Peec AI shows you the analytics. Writesonic takes action and lifts your AI visibility. One global agency...","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.805},"why":"Head-to-head ad that turns doubt about analytics-only tools into a reason to switch.","why_zh":"正面对比广告，把对「只做分析」工具的怀疑转化为换用理由。"},{"postId":682463966,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-07-16","img":"e682463966","text":"Does LLMs.txt actually help you get cited by AI engines?\n\nAccording to our data: not directly.\n\nIt helps agents navigate your website, docs, and API endpoints better. Useful, especially if you are in dev tools or have a lot of technical documentation.\n\nBut it is not a direct ranking or citation…","metrics":{"likes":21,"comments":2,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Myth-busting clip: by Writesonic's data, LLMs.txt is not a direct citation factor; credibility through evidence.","why_zh":"破除迷思的片段：根据 Writesonic 数据，LLMs.txt 并非直接引用因素；以证据建立可信度。"}],"bofu":[{"postId":682463988,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-17","img":"e682463988","text":"Marketers are the worst at marketing themselves out of a bad strategy.\n\nWe'll A/B test button colors for weeks. We'll debate whether the headline has enough urgency. And then we'll keep publishing the same type of content that stopped generating traffic eight months ago because \"SEO takes…","metrics":{"likes":43,"comments":6,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"ABOVE_AVERAGE","conf":0.914},"why":"Opens on 'marketers are the worst at marketing themselves out of a bad strategy' and closes with 'Register below' for a live session.","why_zh":"以「营销人最不擅长把自己从错误策略里营销出来」开篇，以「下方报名」直播课收尾。"},{"postId":682520751,"src":"paid","net":"google","date":"2026-07-25","img":"ea682520751","text":"See the Side-by-Side. Both track AI visibility. Only Writesonic ranks every gap and ships the fixes. Start free, no credit card. See where your brand stands in AI search in minutes. SOC 2 Type II. GDPR Compliant. 10,000+ Marketing Teams. No Credit Card Needed.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Search ad with an explicit 'start free, no credit card' offer plus SOC 2 and GDPR proof points.","why_zh":"搜索广告，明确提供「免费开始、无需信用卡」，并附 SOC 2 与 GDPR 合规背书。"},{"postId":682464107,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-20","img":"e682464107","text":"500M AI searches later, one thing is clear:\n\nMost teams can measure AI visibility. Far fewer can improve it.\n\nA dashboard can tell you your brand is missing from ChatGPT, Gemini, or AI Overviews. It usually cannot tell you what to fix first.\n\nOn April 22, our Founder and CEO, Samanyou Garg, is…","metrics":{"likes":30,"comments":2,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Registration CTA for a Search Engine Journal session aimed at teams 'still tracking the problem more than fixing it'.","why_zh":"Search Engine Journal 研讨会报名号召，面向「仍在追踪问题而非解决问题」的团队。"}]}},{"id":"p3","name":"Stop the SEO treadmill","name_zh":"跳出 SEO 跑步机","verdict":"whitespace","headline":"In the pursuit of progress, sometimes the greatest victories lie in knowing when to step back.","headline_zh":"追求进步时，最大的胜利有时在于懂得适时退一步。","territory":"SEO content is slow and costly and each extra effort buys less. This is the study's largest conversation (150 posts), mostly Arvow's low-engagement volume; Writesonic's only 2 posts here launch bansi AI, so the SEO time-and-cost story is open.","territory_zh":"SEO 内容耗时、昂贵，投入越多回报越少。这是该研究中最大的话题（150 帖），主要是 Arvow 的低互动内容；Writesonic 在此仅有的 2 帖是 bansi AI 发布帖，SEO 时间与成本的叙事仍是空白。","persona":{"themeId":54951,"title":"The Strategic Innovator","characterId":1269,"characterName":"Livia Stratton","summary":"Tech-savvy marketer and founder who uses AI, SEO and digital marketing to grow a business and a career; driven by knowledge, efficiency, empowerment and peer recognition.","created":false},"tension":{"themeId":54955,"type":"pain_points","title":"Navigating the Complex World of SEO: Time, Cost, and Content Challenges","summary":"SEO-optimised content takes too long to produce, agency workflows are complex, rankings are hard to win, backlinks are labour-intensive and costs keep rising as the landscape shifts."},"angle":{"id":14363,"type":"economic","title":"Diminishing Returns on SEO Efforts","text":"Law of Diminishing Returns: each extra hour and dollar put into SEO buys smaller ranking and traffic gains, making the ongoing investment harder to justify.","created":false},"story":{"id":1857,"title":"In the pursuit of progress, sometimes the greatest victories lie in knowing when to step back.","narrative":"The Paradox of SEO Success: Livia's agency clients pour ever more time and budget into SEO for shrinking ranking gains, and burnout spreads. She sees the team running faster on a treadmill, steps back, and rebuilds around quality over quantity and real value. Growth returns once they stop chasing incremental gains.","created":false},"propositions":[{"id":5322,"type":"usp","title":"Transform frustration into clarity with Writesonic","text":"With Writesonic, pinpoint the precise visibility gaps and let our AI agents do the heavy lifting. Tagline: \"From Limbo to Lift: Let Writesonic Light Your Path.\"","created":true},{"id":5321,"type":"rtb","title":"Sometimes, less is more. Step back to elevate your SEO game with Writesonic","text":"Writesonic's GEO platform helps marketing teams take strategic steps back, understanding where to shift focus for greater visibility without unwanted strain. Tagline: \"Reassess. Refocus. Succeed.\"","created":true},{"id":5320,"type":"product_features","title":"Step Back, See Clearly: Level Up Your SEO Game","text":"With Writesonic's Citation Decay feature, you can track the momentum of your SEO efforts and identify which content needs a strategic retreat or a revival.","created":true}],"kpi":{"evidencePosts":150,"engagement":305,"brandPosts":2,"brandEng":65},"sov":{"brandShare":3.5,"categoryShare":46.4,"brandPosts":2,"brandTotal":57,"catPosts":148,"catTotal":319},"trend":{"months":["2026-04","2026-05","2026-06","2026-07"],"brand":[2,0,0,0],"category":[0,3,41,104]},"trendNote":"Monthly organic post counts in this SOMIN theme (posts-aggregate with clusterIds, study window 2026-04-20 to 2026-07-19): April covers 20-30 Apr and July 1-19 Jul only. Category = Search Atlas + Arvow + SEObot + Outrank (SEObot and Outrank post 0). The June-July surge is almost all Arvow (40 and 104 posts); Writesonic appears only in April (2 bansi AI launch posts).","examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682538968,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-07-29","img":"e682538968","text":"Across 2,000+ brands, we measured which sources actually move visibility in AI answers.\n\nYour own website was the weakest one. It gives about a 1.3x lift. YouTube gives 3.19x. Reddit 3.17x. Gartner 3.15x.\n\nI still see AI visibility treated as an extra column in the SEO report. That shortcut is…","metrics":{"likes":46,"comments":4,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Shows owned-site content gives the weakest lift (about 1.3x vs 3.19x for YouTube): more on-site effort hits diminishing returns.","why_zh":"数据显示自有网站带来的提升最弱（约 1.3 倍，YouTube 为 3.19 倍）：继续加码站内投入，回报递减。"},{"postId":682463982,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-07-02","img":"e682463982","text":"We measured which citation sources move brands into AI answers.\n\nNot which sources get cited most often. Which ones change whether a brand appears.\n\nThe sample: 2,000+ brands, every category.\n\nThe top 3 by influence lift: → YouTube: 3.19x → Reddit: 3.17x → Gartner: 3.15x\n\nThe bottom: your own…","metrics":{"likes":21,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"The underlying study: most content budget goes to owned pages, 'the lowest-lift channel we found'.","why_zh":"背后的研究：大部分内容预算投向自有页面，即「我们发现提升最低的渠道」。"},{"postId":682836310,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-09-03","img":"e682836310","text":"Coming next week: Turnover.\n\nOur new report is based on 2B+ AI conversations across 10+ platforms and 50+ markets.\n\nA closer look at how AI search is actually changing, where the movement is happening, and what marketers should be paying attention to now.\n\nWhat looks stable on the surface really…","metrics":{"likes":31,"comments":9,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Teaser for the Turnover report ('What looks stable on the surface really isn't'): awareness with no conversion ask.","why_zh":"Turnover 报告预热（「表面稳定，其实不然」）：纯认知内容，无转化要求。"}],"mofu":[{"postId":682464035,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-24","img":"e682464035","text":"80% of LLM citations don’t even rank in Google for the original query. (Source: Louise L., Ahrefs)\n\nAnswer engines don’t choose sources the same way traditional search engines do. And therefore, the way you optimize content for both platforms should also be different.\n\nIn my latest article for…","metrics":{"likes":29,"comments":9,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"ABOVE_AVERAGE","conf":0.825},"why":"Reshared guest article on writing citation-friendly content; the infographic gives six how-to rules that cut wasted effort.","why_zh":"转发的客座文章，讲如何写出易被引用的内容；信息图给出六条减少无效投入的方法。"},{"postId":682768140,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-08-26","img":"e682768140","text":"Marketers are being asked to invest more in AI visibility.\n\nBut where do you move budget if you cannot see what AI agents are actually doing on your site?\n\nOur AI Agent Analytics gives you that layer.\n\nSee which AI systems access your site, which pages they rely on, what they are crawling for…","metrics":{"likes":12,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.907},"why":"AI Agent Analytics explainer framed as 'where do you move budget' when you cannot see what AI agents do on your site.","why_zh":"AI Agent Analytics 功能说明，切入点是「看不到 AI 代理在网站上做什么时，预算该往哪挪」。"},{"postId":683025765,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-09-24","img":"e683025765","text":"We could tell you which pages AI engines were citing. We could not tell you whether those pages were still winning.\n\nThat changes today.\n\nCitation Decay is now live in Writesonic.\n\nEvery cited page now gets a Momentum status: Rising, Holding, Declining, Faded, Recovering, Dormant, or New…","metrics":{"likes":28,"comments":6,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Citation Decay launch: Momentum status, half-life and 14-day trend per cited page show which content is worth refreshing.","why_zh":"Citation Decay 发布：每个被引页面的动量状态、半衰期与 14 天趋势，说明哪些内容值得更新。"}],"bofu":[{"postId":682936065,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-09-14","img":"e682936065","text":"Is your SEO strategy ready for AI search? 🚀\n\nSearch is evolving fast, and traditional SEO tactics alone won’t cut it in the era of Generative Engine Optimization (GEO).\n\nThe Writesonic team is landing at brightonSEO, and we’re bringing the future of AI-driven content, GEO, and search optimization…","metrics":{"likes":13,"comments":3,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Offers a free micro-audit and 1-on-1 slots, arguing traditional SEO tactics alone won't cut it.","why_zh":"提供免费微型审计和一对一时段，主张仅靠传统 SEO 手段已不够。"},{"postId":682463957,"src":"paid","net":"google","date":"2025-07-06","img":"ea682463957","text":"Writesonic vs HubSpot AEO - They Grade. We Fix and Prove. HubSpot AEO tracks your AI visibility. Writesonic tracks it and ships the work to lift it. Sitelinks: Pricing / See the Side-by-Side / Start Free, No Card Needed / Book a Demo.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Search ad whose sitelinks go straight to Pricing, Start Free and Book a Demo; the copy promises Writesonic 'ships the work'.","why_zh":"搜索广告的附加链接直达定价、免费开始与预约演示；文案承诺 Writesonic「直接交付工作」。"},{"postId":682464055,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-24","img":"e682464055","text":"We built an AI video editor for long-form videos. It's called bansi AI.\n                                                                           \nUpload raw footage. Get back a polished video with smart cuts, captions, B-roll, sound…","metrics":{"likes":38,"comments":6,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"One of Writesonic's 2 posts SOMIN placed in this tension, but it launches bansi AI (the team's long-form video editor) with a free first project; a time-saving offer, not an SEO one.","why_zh":"SOMIN 归入该痛点的 2 条 Writesonic 帖子之一，但内容是 bansi AI（团队的长视频剪辑工具）发布并赠送首个项目；节省时间的优惠，而非 SEO 产品。"}]}}],"created":{"studies":[],"characters":[],"angles":[],"stories":[],"products":[1476],"propositions":[5314,5315,5316,5317,5318,5319,5320,5321,5322]},"notes":["Chain reuses the 3 existing SOMIN stories (1855, 1856, 1857), each on a different study-7114 tension; no study, character, angle or story was created. All three share the only character in the workspace (Livia Stratton, character 1269, persona theme 54951 The Strategic Innovator).","Study 7114 A-ORG-WS-90D: organic (PAGES), 2026-04-20 to 2026-07-19, audience filter Small Business Owners / SMEs / Entrepreneurs / Business Owners. SOV totals = sum over the study's themes of the same type: Writesonic 57 posts; competitors 319 (Search Atlas 32, Arvow 287, SEObot 0, Outrank 0). Theme counts were re-checked with posts-aggregate (54957 total 36 / 1,093 eng).","p2 verdict is contested rather than owned: Writesonic over-indexes slightly on post share (17.5% vs 14.1%), but Search Atlas earns 634 engagements in the theme vs Writesonic 222.","Created product 1476 (Writesonic AI Search Visibility Platform, b2b) on profile 20500 using only facts from Writesonic's own posts and ads (Citation Decay, AI Agent Analytics, AI Ads Index, Turnover report, G2 recognition, and the search-ad claims \"10,000+ marketing teams\", \"SOC 2 Type II\", \"GDPR compliant\", \"start free, no credit card\"). No prices invented.","Created 9 propositions (5314-5322) = 3 stories x focus usp / rtb / product_features. SOMIN generated 5 variants per proposition; the dashboard shows one each (variant ids: 5316->22626, 5315->22623, 5314->22617, 5319->22639, 5318->22636, 5317->22631, 5322->22655, 5321->22649, 5320->22644). Proposition copy is SOMIN-generated, lightly trimmed.","Examples: posts-search with clusterIds per tension (brand profile, PAGES, study window) returned 2 / 10 / 2 brand posts for p1 / p2 / p3; the rest come from the brand's posts sorted by engagement since 2026-04-20 (3 pages of 8), a contentIds lookup of posts already in posts.json, and the brand's 6 Google Search ads (ADS_LIBRARY), matched to pillars by topic, humanInsight and caption. Each post is used once.","Paid examples are Google Search text ads whose SOMIN features are \"Undetermined\"; their copy was read from SOMIN's archived ad screenshots (checked visually). Ads 682463956/682463953/682463957 have SOMIN first-seen date 2025-07-06 and end 2026-07-18; 682520751 ran 2026-07-25 to 07-26.","Score gate: 7 of 27 examples pass (>0.80): 682883349 AVERAGE 0.857, 682936063 ABOVE 0.813, 682463956 AVERAGE 0.861, 682463953 AVERAGE 0.805, 682463988 ABOVE 0.914, 682464035 ABOVE 0.825, 682768140 AVERAGE 0.907. For multi-image posts the score is from the image shown (the first).","Excluded: 682464010 (SearchShop post reshared on Writesonic's page; its DM/email CTA is SearchShop's), 682464096 (second bansi AI launch post, near-duplicate of 682464055), 682464174 (Facebook copy of the LLMs.txt clip used from LinkedIn), 682463954 (AirOps comparison ad, no image), 682463960 (German duplicate of \"A GEO Platform That Acts\").","682463982 sits in SOMIN cluster 54961 (p2) but is shown in p3 because its point (owned content is the lowest-lift channel) is the diminishing-returns tension; several examples (682463998, 682464035, 682463988, 682463959) are posts reshared on the Writesonic company page, as indexed by SOMIN under profile 20500.","LinkedIn exposes reposts, not shares or views, so shares/views are null; a missing comment count is shown as 0. Ads carry no engagement metrics.","No concept renders were needed: every stage has 3 real examples. Trend months April and July are partial (study window edges)."]},{"e682883349":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463959":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682538967":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463962":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682748449":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464017":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682936063":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464019":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463947":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463998":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464106":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463977":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682463956":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682463953":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463966":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463988":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682520751":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464107":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682538968":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682463982":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682836310":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464035":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682768140":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e683025765":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682936065":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682463957":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464055":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"});
